	<meta property="og:description" content="The Historical Preservation Committee of the Libertarian National Committee is pleased to announce that, after hard work by several dedicated volunteers, LPedia.org is open and welcome for new account creation and use as a resource for party members. LPedia is a collaborative wiki of the history of the Libertarian Party and will be the home to the [&hellip;]" />
